Released CEF 156.0.15 / cef-rs 156.3.0 experimental migration.
Apply in a disposable checkout, stage matching codec-enabled CEF artifacts,
and build x86-64 only until matching ARM artifacts are available.
Production Flatpak engine pins are intentionally not changed by this patch.
No pending NVIDIA synchronization patch is included.

